      "body": "Mutation:\r\n\r\n```diff\r\ndiff --git a/src/serialize.h b/src/serialize.h\r\nindex 9a1ff56ec4..81d675c3c0 100644\r\n--- a/src/serialize.h\r\n+++ b/src/serialize.h\r\n@@ -358,5 +358,2 @@ uint64_t ReadCompactSize(Stream& is, bool range_check = true)\r\n     }\r\n-    if (range_check && nSizeRet > MAX_SIZE) {\r\n-        throw std::ios_base::failure(\"ReadCompactSize(): size too large\");\r\n-    }\r\n     return nSizeRet;\r\n```\r\n\r\n<!---\r\n\r\n+BOOST_AUTO_TEST_CASE(compactsize_type_range)\r\n+{\r\n+    using Fmt = CompactSizeFormatter</*RangeCheck=*/false>; // Only type check\r\n+    DataStream ss{};\r\n+    ss << Using<Fmt>(uint64_t{std::numeric_limits<uint32_t>::max()} + 1);\r\n+    uint32_t value;\r\n+    BOOST_CHECK_EXCEPTION(ss >> Using<Fmt>(value), std::ios_base::failure, HasReason{\"CompactSize exceeds limit of type\"});\r\n+}\r\n",
